            <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>AgentDock on your iPhone, anywhere.</strong></p>
<ul><li><strong>The AgentDock iPhone app</strong> pairs with a code in Settings › iPhone and shows your agents and the Inbox: answer, reply, send next steps and undo, like on the Mac.</li><li><strong>A relay</strong> lets the app reach your Mac when you're away from your network. Everything is encrypted end to end with a key that only lives in the pairing code, so the relay can't read or change anything. Enter its address in Settings › iPhone › Relay (how to run one: relay/README.md in the source).</li><li>Without a relay, the app and the Safari page work on the same network as before.</li></ul>
]]></description>
